entries.text:
Welcome to the Union Room.{VAR BE01}
If there is anything you need help
with, please let me know! {VAR BE01}

There are five Battle Formats.{VAR BE01}
Single Battle is for two Trainers
with one or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer can have one Pokémon
in battle at a time.{VAR BE01}
Double Battle is for two Trainers
with two or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer will send out two
Pokémon to battle at a time.{VAR BE01}
Triple Battle is for two Trainers
with three or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer will send out three
Pokémon to battle at a time.{VAR BE01}

Rotation Battle is for two Trainers
with three or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer sends out three Pokémon at
a time, one in front and two in the back.{VAR BE01}
Multi Battle is for four Trainers
with one or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}
Each Trainer can have one Pokémon
in battle at a time.{VAR BE01}

You may trade your Pokémon with
other players.{VAR BE01}
Meeting new people could be a
shortcut to meeting rare Pokémon!{VAR BE01}

In a Spin Trade, participants each bring
an Egg for trading with others.{VAR BE01}
Which Egg will you end up with?
What kind of Pokémon is in that Egg?{VAR BE00}
It's quite exciting and fun!{VAR BE01}
Up to five players can take part, so
try it with your friends!{VAR BE01}

You may get together with others
and draw a picture.{VAR BE01}
You all get to work on one sheet
of paper at the same time.{VAR BE01}
I'm sure a drawing made by friends
will be a memorable masterpiece!{VAR BE01}
Up to five players can take part,
so try it with your friends!{VAR BE01}

If you touch an icon on the bar
on the Touch Screen below,{VAR BE00}
you can choose words for chatting{VAR BE00}
or tell others what you want to do,{VAR BE00}
such as battles or trades.{VAR BE01}
Also, players who have chosen the same
icon as you will jump up and down{VAR BE00}
so you can spot them easily.{VAR BE01}
Touch any icon to find a person you want
to play with.{VAR BE01}
